 "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 9654, "client_id": 89828, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/81c3e7e9/uploads/origins/b0e3fe68-d759-4878-8ce8-c168038481ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7dc121f90487157d863b2137505b2f0", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/81c3e7e9/uploads/origins/b0e3fe68-d759-4878-8ce8-c168038481ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d229da4726a476adfee67f8218cb743d", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！自分のキャラクターのイラストをお願いします。基本的にネコで、尻尾がふわふわしています。指は4本、足指は3本です。ポーズやシチュエーションはお任せします。よろしくお願いします！:)\n\n参考リンク : https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DMps_vqcfZP44MRDUdAsMvl0unL2dkYR?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tabiari/works/22", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 9654, "client_id": 162528, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/90f9e29a/uploads/origins/f1aaf015-17fa-4a85-961f-eae115b56dc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=72b5851175aed438402ee8eaee371977", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/90f9e29a/uploads/origins/f1aaf015-17fa-4a85-961f-eae115b56dc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=37b6edbd65b205a4c6a3535c0fdbfb90", "src_set": ""}, "body": "初めまして！あなたのスタイルとても好きです！\n\nI would like to commission my character with your cute art style!\nFree expression in any pose and background. \n\nCharacter Ref. \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NAdC9LrOtld-DGaYvxCou1CKWGzfnnt1?usp=drive_link\n\nありがとうございます！", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_accep