としては体型が比較的大きいので、そのモフモフな全身で皆を包み込んで癒やすのが得意。\n可愛いものが好き。\nちょっといたずらっ子な部分があるかもしれない。\n\n＜使用用途＞\n・SNSのアイコンなどの個人利用、配信でのイラスト紹介など\n\nhttps://x.com/Legato_VR/status/1480897242412490753", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tabiari/works/19", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 9654, "client_id": 2515734, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a33f63b6/uploads/origins/14fba018-9ee1-44d9-821c-4e64d7f71401?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4535b645a0506068ee0922495b67c79e", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a33f63b6/uploads/origins/14fba018-9ee1-44d9-821c-4e64d7f71401?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9239206e3c77b039601b9aa7682c8967", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I would like to request an illustration of my character \"Hana\". She is a flying squirrel who loves sweets and dango🍡.  Hana has pink eyelashes, rabbit-like front teeth, and plump palms. I like the kemono art style. I leave the background and pose up to you!\n\nReferences: https://toyhou.se/17712225.hana/77106337\nhttps://toyhou.se/17712225.hana/80528840\nPlease use this as a design reference!\n\nHana’s art gallery:\nhttps://toyhou.se/17712225.hana/gallery\nYou may use this gallery for inspiration, but the designs might not be accurate.\n\nI would appreciate it if you could approve my request. Thank you for your consideration.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tabiari/works/18", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 9654, "client_id": 420985, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3f69a2a3/uploads/origins/e0f2e2bd-9f54-4d66-b814-c709af29e049?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c672c443067568cee854448b1fd16d56", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3f69a2a3/uploads/origins/e0f2e2bd-9f54-4d66-b814-c709af29e049?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=37323cb1e1856414d8bdd01f9f9c0d9e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！僕のキャラクター、AJと何かしたいんだ！\n彼は猫と犬のハーフです。\n服装、テーマ、ポーズも自由です！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1c1-S2J0j-1fTftO9T0Xz87RrZ9VptVob/view?usp=drive_link", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tabiari/works/17", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 9654, "client_id": 157414, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e55c1677/uploads/origins/e36301af-bac8-49e4-a640-7a8093e9ebeb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2b6ff75a9478f3e884becaf894048ee", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e55c1677/uploads/origins/e36301af-bac8-49e4-a640-7a8093e9ebeb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7d882914adba2428d6d584402181a954", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、またクロヤです。\n\n先回、たびさんのイラストを描いて頂き、ありがとうこざいます。\nそのイラストを見ると、いつもうれしいです！\nこの度、再リクエストしていただけないでしょうか。\n\n【キャラクター】\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cwsmvAn4tEDg2qaw51jBZrlTL_Jf75Cd?usp=drive_link\n種族：青い猫少年\n注意点：\n髪の毛はセンター分けしないで、鼻テープが好きです！\n首輪と金属飾り物は大切なものです。\n\n\n今回の背景や服装や構図など、お任せにしていかがでしょうか。\n\n何でもいいです。\n\nでも、ちょっと恥ずかしい表情がほしいです。\n\n大変お手数ですが、今回は黒縁メガネの差分がほしいです。\n\nいつもたびさんの黒縁メガネの猫さんを見ると、抱きしめたいと思いますね！\n\n\nご不明なところがあれば、ご自由にお描きいただければと思います。\n\nもう一度、ご検討の程、よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tabiari/works/16", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 9654, "client_id": 2925421, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/db59c181/uploads/origins/08b181b9-4419-4c82-ad7b-b9e2a42e12cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8b5763a12d5c9568ed1a1cc5ef9b2b5", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/db59c181/uploads/origins/08b181b9-4419-4c82-ad7b-b9e2a42e12cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=28256b5f3608d5390ea25eec8aad5f93", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの描いた毛皮がとても気に入ったので、私のOCを描いてください。\nどんなポーズでも背景でも大歓迎です！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-VJyF9P-_aJMCY_32TaTVgzNCHS7wEv7?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tabiari/works/15", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 9654, "client_id": 1453550, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fc0524d5/uploads/origins/5f8028c7-6548-4775-abb5-d66a1baea790?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c15be6de2f3b2c1e097524658141009", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fc0524d5/uploads/origins/5f8028c7-6548-4775-abb5-d66a1baea790?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6ceb3c100a77e92c66b9e248d530f53f", "src_set": ""}, "body": "先生、こんにちは！先生の絵がとても好きで、私のキャラクターを描きたいと思っています。黒猫で、バーテンダーで、できればビールを少し酔う程度に飲むなど、お酒の要素も入れて、髪には金色の王冠のバレッタ、左目の下には三つ星の模様、右目の下には下向きの矢印の模様、手袋を外すと黄色い肉球が耳のように見えます。若さゆえの照れや可愛らしさ、できれば可愛い表情は拙い採点でお願いしたいです、先生もご自由にどうぞ。\n私のキャラの写真ですが、よろしいでしょうか？\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/112ruIh6MMdNEW1xWtaHAGabHONj3PBNM/view?usp=sharing\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1hLtp96qzftYIek1wKM98oQkjzttKWPxL/view?usp=sharing\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1DKJLn5P_QaeV1JggSRTczrWrnWcsQTGs/view?usp=sharing\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/13T1p353UGvSsBCC_YrdAf4K8lxZ0p8iB/view?usp=sharing\nありがとうございます！", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tabiari/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 9654, "client_id": 2615137, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f0bd6f3/uploads/origins/728cd234-6eab-4af4-9ce2-e04c69fe96d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5a07ffd073c2b35f4880a1c245bc76c1", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f0bd6f3/uploads/origins/728cd234-6eab-4af4-9ce2-e04c69fe96d6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3e94949c5850474e80a8e47cf0703a07", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi!\n\nRevisiting you in a long time~!! 💖\n\nCan you please draw something for my child, 'Sera'?\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rnf52O2NbF5HfOFSKcZ01uNuuwn7L8t8?usp=drive_link\n\nPlease draw as you wish, any pose or background will do.\n\nThank you!! ☺️", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tabiari/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 9654, "client_id": 66065, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c3e01c44/uploads/origins/884e3b5d-bd17-450e-b78e-832387c9e467?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2297dc6d4bf2d5bf6149346b55d856c3", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": 